      "rationale": "The span explicitly requires testing the proposed change against the unreduced baseline and states why reduced-case success alone is insufficient."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C037.signal_basis",
    "value": "A smaller configuration repeatedly reproduces lateness while specified further removals cease to reproduce it, with test conditions held fixed and a common repetition rule distinguishing reproducible results from unresolved outcomes.",
    "scope": "Reduction tests for the selected late case; the signal concerns tested configurations.",
